            <div type="translation" xml:lang="en" resp="#AA">
                <p>To Titus Appalius Alfinus Secundus, son of Titus, of tribe Velina, procurator of the Augustan 5% tax on inheritances, procurator of the Alpes Atrectionae
                    prefect of vehicles, under-prefect of the praetorian fleet at Ravenna, prefect of Ala I Augusta Thracum, tribune of the 1st cohort Aelia Brittonum,
                    prefect of the 4th cohort Gallorum, patron of the colony, flamen of all the divi, augur, duovir, quinquennalis twice, [this was erected] on account of 
                    his merits, by decree of the decurions.
                </p>
